wf-npc-intent-demand-1 = Hold it. {$amount} thalers and you walk.
wf-npc-intent-demand-2 = Easy now. Hand over {$amount} thalers.
wf-npc-intent-demand-3 = {$amount} thalers. Now. Don't make this hard.
wf-npc-intent-paid-1 = Pleasure. Now get lost.
wf-npc-intent-paid-2 = Smart. We're done here.
wf-npc-intent-short-1 = That's not enough. I said {$amount} more.
wf-npc-intent-short-2 = Short. {$amount} more.
wf-npc-intent-refused-1 = Wrong answer.
wf-npc-intent-refused-2 = Have it your way.
wf-npc-intent-mug-1 = Thanks for the donation.
wf-npc-intent-mug-2 = You won't be needing this.
